cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "TaalTrainer"
abstract: >-
  A self-contained Hindustani classical tabla practice room and microtiming
  analyzer. Synthesizes thirteen bol strokes across three AudioWorklet
  processor families, drives four cyclic taal loops, and transcribes phrases
  into Devanagari bol notation.
type: software
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/draarivpatel-ui/taaltrainer"
url: "https://draarivpatel-ui.github.io/taaltrainer/"
keywords:
  - tabla
  - taal
  - hindustani-classical
  - audioworklet
  - music-education
  - javascript
  - zero-dependency
